        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Any allotments for non-bargaining unit employees for supplemental pension plans or other benefits may not be processed via SF 1187. SF-50's reverting temporarily promoted LIUNA members from supervisory positions back to the bargaining unit will include a statement reinstating the Employee's Union dues withholding. Finance offices will verify membership status prior to the temporary promotion and will place them in their original status.",
